          "type": "question_answer",
          "name": "Subscriptions Question and answer",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How Do I Make Changes To My Subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>Your subscription can be amended and updated from your Phoenix Gravity Account. Once you’ve logged into your account, click on subscriptions to make any changes.<br/><br/>If you need any further help, please don’t hesitate to contact us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_answer_PNRjxz": {
          "type": "question_answer",
          "name": "Subscriptions Question and answer",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I Skip Or Cancel My Subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can make changes to frequency or cancel your subscription at any time.<br/><br/>Please note that cancelling your subscription will forfeit any special pricing on your subscription, so if you wish to re-subscribe after canceling, you may not be able to recover the same special pricing you had previously.</p>"
          }
